OL,3,GNEWSAA different kind of drama - the
OL,4,Avisually-impaired actors creating
OL,5,Apictures through sound
OL,6,
OL,7,FA box of gravel, a handful of leaves
OL,8,Fand a miniature door might not sound
OL,9,Flike the ingredients for a wedding day
OL,10,Fdrama.
OL,12,FBut in a room filled with people
OL,13,Fexperimenting with sounds, they are
OL,14,Fhelping to bring an entire world to
OL,15,Flife.
OL,17,FFor a group of blind and
OL,18,Fpartially-sighted people, an
OL,19,Faudio-based drama workshop is giving
OL,20,Fthem the chance to explore performance
OL,21,F- without relying on visual cues.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
