OL,3,GNEWSAA different kind of drama - the
OL,4,Avisually-impaired actors creating
OL,5,Apictures through sound
OL,6,
OL,7,FInstead, they are using sound to create
OL,8,Fcharacters, settings and stories,
OL,9,Fbuilding a picture in the audience's
OL,10,Fmind without showing them a single
OL,11,Fimage.
